PatchClosure-Bench :: camaleon-cms-cve-2026-1776
CVE-2024-46987 (original, local uploader) -> CVE-2026-1776 (residual, AWS S3 uploader)
Gate run: 2026-07-17  (real Docker: 3 gem-pinned Camaleon images + real minio S3 backend)

