CLEAN incomplete-fix differential:
  original (local) : reach@v0  ->  BLOCKED@v1     (CVE-2024-46987 closed local)
  residual (S3)    : reach@v1  ->  BLOCKED@v2     (CVE-2026-1776 closed the S3 backend the prior fix missed)
  original != residual on V1 (local blocked, S3 reaches); V1 does NOT block the S3 residual.

