================================================================================
ENV GOTCHAS (recorded for reproducibility)
================================================================================
- minio rejects Host headers containing '_' => "Invalid Request (invalid hostname)". Use an
  underscore-free endpoint host (compose service/alias 'minio'). Avoid bucket.exists? (HEAD =>
  BadRequest on minio); create the bucket with create_bucket + rescue.
- The `../` traversal needs Rails.root/private to exist on disk (OS resolves `..` only through an
  existing dir). LocalUploader creates it at request time; for the S3 backend the entrypoint
  mkdir's it (the on-disk private-media dir that any real Camaleon deployment serving private files
  has). The vuln (missing `..` check in AwsUploader) is 100% the real gem code.
- OrbStack may leak host port-forwards from failed containers; ports 39670-39673 chosen fresh.
